WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.874
Read accurately, with natural phrasing and a suitable pace; notice when words do not

00:00:04.874 --> 00:00:06.877
fit the context and correct them.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.872
A learner rushes and misses small words. What should improve? Answer: Slow to a

00:00:12.872 --> 00:00:14.719
manageable pace and check accuracy.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.120
Read aloud for one minute and reread a paragraph more accurately after feedback.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.873
Why it works: Accurate pace supports comprehension.
